  "instructions": [
    "in a mortar and pestle, pound the coriander, cumin, chili powder, turmeric, and garam masala until well combined.",
    "add the coconut oil and pound until the spices are well coated.",
    "add the black beans and pound until they are well coated with the spice mixture.",
    "add the coconut milk and pound until the mixture is well combined.",
    "heat a small non-stick pan over medium heat and add the black bean mixture.",
    "cook for 5-7 minutes or until the mixture thickens.',\n      \"stir in the lemon juice and brown sugar.",
    "cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "remove from heat and season with salt to taste.",
    "garnish with peanuts or cashews and serve hot.",
    "serve with rice or roti for a complete meal."
  ],
